sync Plugin for DokuWiki

============================================================================================================================
Updated for PHP8-8.2
WARNING: my changes have had very little testing - if it breaks you get to keep both pieces
Do not install this plugin as it will create confusion in the Dokuwiki Extension Manager
To use: Install Andreas Gohr's dokuwiki-plugin-sync from https://github.com/splitbrain/dokuwiki-plugin-sync/zipball/master
Then download admin.php from this repository and overwrite /lib/plugins/sync/admin.php
Check the permission on admin.php after you've done that (usually www-data:www-data 644)
============================================================================================================================

All documentation for this plugin can be found at
http://www.dokuwiki.org/plugin:sync

If you install this plugin manually, make sure it is installed in
lib/plugins/sync/ - if the folder is called different it
will not work!

Please refer to http://www.dokuwiki.org/plugins for additional info
on how to install plugins in DokuWiki.

